1527
01:12:20,468 --> 01:12:21,268
ただの脅しっぽい。
Seems like just intimidation.

1528
01:12:22,488 --> 01:12:25,648
脅すとか、やめてよちょっとそんなの。脅されたらけっぽい。
Threatening or whatever, stop that a bit. Looks like we were threatened.

